    var paragraphs=["To whom it may concern:","I am pleased to provide this recommendation letter draft for "+(state.name||"the learner"),"who completed the five-day Digital Enablement Basics for Engineers learning journey powered by Mentor Kapil.","During the programme, the learner completed all required daily learning activities and assessments across "+(passed===5?"cloud computing; information security and privacy; artificial intelligence and generative AI; IoT and blockchain; and emerging engineering technologies.":completed.map(function(l){return l.short;}).join(", ")+".")+" The course paired clear technical notes with hands-on practice and applied engineering scenarios.","The work demonstrates commitment to continued learning and an ability to connect digital concepts with practical engineering needs. This draft is intended for the mentor to verify, personalize, and approve before it is issued as a recommendation.","With regards,","Mentor Kapil · Powered by Mentor Kapil","Digital Enablement Basics for Engineers"];
